{
  "sctemplate": "0.1",
  "meta": {
    "id": "claude-code",
    "name": "Claude Code"
  },
  "size": {
    "width": 1920,
    "height": 1080
  },
  "theme": {
    "colors": {
      "canvas": "#0D0B0A",
      "ink": "#938C84",
      "muted": "#D97757",
      "accent": "#F4F1EA",
      "hairline": "#CFC8B9",
      "tone-1": "#6B655E",
      "tone-2": "#E5E0D5"
    },
    "fonts": {
      "display": "Didot, 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif",
      "body": "Didot, 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif",
      "mono": "'JetBrains Mono', Menlo, ui-monospace, monospace"
    },
    "textStyles": {
      "display": {
        "fontFamily": "$fonts.display",
        "fontSize": 168,
        "fontWeight": 400,
        "lineHeight": 0.9,
        "letterSpacing": -7,
        "color": "$colors.accent"
      },
      "h1": {
        "fontFamily": "$fonts.display",
        "fontSize": 88,
        "fontWeight": 400,
        "lineHeight": 1.02,
        "letterSpacing": -3,
        "color": "$colors.accent"
      },
      "body": {
        "fontFamily": "'Avenir Next', Avenir, 'Optima', sans-serif",
        "fontSize": 30,
        "fontWeight": 400,
        "lineHeight": 1.55,
        "color": "$colors.ink"
      },
      "code": {
        "fontFamily": "$fonts.mono",
        "fontSize": 22,
        "fontWeight": 400,
        "lineHeight": 1.7,
        "color": "$colors.ink"
      },
      "caption": {
        "fontFamily": "$fonts.mono",
        "fontSize": 18,
        "fontWeight": 500,
        "letterSpacing": 5,
        "color": "$colors.muted",
        "textTransform": "uppercase"
      }
    }
  },
  "layouts": [
    {
      "id": "cover",
      "name": "Portada",
      "slide": {
        "id": "cover",
        "name": "Portada",
        "background": {
          "type": "solid",
          "color": "$colors.canvas"
        },
        "layers": [
          {
            "id": "main",
            "nodes": [
              {
                "id": "cover-hero3d",
                "name": "Hero 3D",
                "frame": {
                  "x": 1040,
                  "y": 70,
                  "w": 920,
                  "h": 920
                },
                "type": "code-block",
                "code": "const T=(slidecode.theme&&slidecode.theme.colors)||{};\nconst ACC=T.accent||'#D97757';\nconst COOL='#4A6CFF';\nconst SKIP=slidecode.mode==='edit';\ndocument.body.style.cssText='margin:0;overflow:hidden;background:transparent';\nconst renderer=new THREE.WebGLRenderer({antialias:true,alpha:true});\nrenderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(devicePixelRatio||1,2));\nrenderer.setSize(innerWidth,innerHeight);\ndocument.body.appendChild(renderer.domElement);\nconst scene=new THREE.Scene();\nconst camera=new THREE.PerspectiveCamera(36,innerWidth/innerHeight,0.1,100);\ncamera.position.set(0,0.3,7.2);\nconst group=new THREE.Group();scene.add(group);\nconst core=new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.IcosahedronGeometry(1.85,0),new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({color:0x1b1613,metalness:0.95,roughness:0.24,flatShading:true}));\ngroup.add(core);\nconst wire=new THREE.LineSegments(new THREE.EdgesGeometry(new THREE.IcosahedronGeometry(2.45,1)),new THREE.LineBasicMaterial({color:new THREE.Color(ACC),transparent:true,opacity:0.2}));\ngroup.add(wire);\nconst N=210,pos=new Float32Array(N*3);\nfor(let i=0;i<N;i++){const a=i*2.39996,r=2.95+(Math.sin(i*12.9)*0.5+0.5)*1.75;pos[i*3]=Math.cos(a)*r;pos[i*3+1]=Math.cos(i*7.7)*2.05;pos[i*3+2]=Math.sin(a)*r;}\nconst dg=new THREE.BufferGeometry();dg.setAttribute('position',new THREE.BufferAttribute(pos,3));\nconst dust=new THREE.Points(dg,new THREE.PointsMaterial({color:new THREE.Color(ACC),size:0.05,transparent:true,opacity:0.5}));\ngroup.add(dust);\nconst key=new THREE.PointLight(new THREE.Color(ACC),300);key.position.set(4,3,4);scene.add(key);\nconst rim=new THREE.PointLight(new THREE.Color(COOL),140);rim.position.set(-5,-2,2.5);scene.add(rim);\nconst top=new THREE.PointLight(0xF4F1EA,70);top.position.set(0,6,-3);scene.add(top);\nscene.add(new THREE.AmbientLight(0x1a1512,2.2));\naddEventListener('resize',function(){camera.aspect=innerWidth/innerHeight;camera.updateProjectionMatrix();renderer.setSize(innerWidth,innerHeight);});\nlet px=0,py=0,tx=0,ty=0;\nslidecode.onPointer(function(p){if(p&&p.inside){tx=p.x-0.5;ty=p.y-0.5;}else{tx=0;ty=0;}});\nconst expo=function(t){return t>=1?1:1-Math.pow(2,-10*t);};\nlet start=null;\nfunction frame(now){\n  if(start===null)start=now;\n  const t=now-start;\n  const k=SKIP?1:expo(Math.min(t/1500,1));\n  px+=(tx-px)*0.045;py+=(ty-py)*0.045;\n  group.scale.setScalar(0.55+0.45*k);\n  group.position.y=(1-k)*-1.4+Math.sin(t/1800)*0.14;\n  group.rotation.y=t/4400+px*0.55;\n  group.rotation.x=Math.sin(t/5400)*0.26+py*0.4;\n  wire.rotation.y=-t/6200;wire.rotation.z=t/8200;\n  dust.rotation.y=t/9200;\n  key.intensity=300+Math.sin(t/980)*70;\n  dust.material.opacity=(0.2+0.3*(Math.sin(t/1600)*0.5+0.5))*k;\n  wire.material.opacity=0.2*k;\n  renderer.render(scene,camera);\n  requestAnimationFrame(frame);\n}\nslidecode.onReveal(function(){requestAnimationFrame(frame);});\n",
                "libs": [
                  "three"
                ]
              },
              {
                "id": "cover-kicker",
                "name": "Kicker",
                "frame": {
                  "x": 120,
                  "y": 300,
                  "w": 700,
                  "h": 30
                },
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Anthropic · 2026",
                "styleRef": "$textStyles.caption"
              },
              {
                "id": "hero-word",
                "name": "Wordmark",
                "frame": {
                  "x": 112,
                  "y": 350,
                  "w": 900,
                  "h": 400
                },
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Claude\nCode",
                "styleRef": "$textStyles.display",
                "style": {
                  "fontSize": 190,
                  "lineHeight": 0.86,
                  "letterSpacing": -9
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "cover-rule",
                "name": "Filete",
                "frame": {
                  "x": 120,
                  "y": 790,
                  "w": 420,
                  "h": 2
                },
                "opacity": 0.32,
                "type": "shape",
                "shape": "rect",
                "fill": {
                  "type": "solid",
                  "color": "$colors.ink"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "cover-sub",
                "name": "Subtítulo",
                "frame": {
                  "x": 120,
                  "y": 830,
                  "w": 790,
                  "h": 140
                },
                "type": "text",
                "text": "El agente de programación que vive en tu terminal, tu editor y tu navegador.",
                "styleRef": "$textStyles.body",
                "style": {
                  "fontSize": 32,
                  "color": "$colors.accent"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "cover-foot",
                "name": "Pie",
                "frame": {
                  "x": 1480,
                  "y": 1000,
                  "w": 320,
                  "h": 26
                },
                "type": "text",
                "text": "12 láminas",
                "styleRef": "$textStyles.caption",
                "style": {
                  "fontSize": 15,
                  "color": "$colors.ink",
                  "align": "right"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "builds": [
          {
            "id": "cover-in",
            "trigger": "auto",
            "actions": [
              {
                "nodeId": "cover-kicker",
                "effect": "slideIn",
                "duration": 0.6,
                "delay": 0.1,
                "easing": "easeOut",
                "direction": "up",
                "distance": 22
              },
              {
                "nodeId": "hero-word",
                "effect": "slideIn",
                "duration": 1,
                "delay": 0.24,
                "easing": "easeOut",
                "direction": "up",
                "distance": 96
              },
              {
                "nodeId": "cover-rule",
                "effect": "slideIn",
                "duration": 0.8,
                "delay": 0.8,
                "easing": "easeOut",
                "direction": "left",
                "distance": 340
              },
              {
                "nodeId": "cover-sub",
                "effect": "fadeIn",
                "duration": 0.8,
                "delay": 0.96,
                "easing": "easeOut"
              },
              {
                "nodeId": "cover-foot",
                "effect": "fadeIn",
                "duration": 0.7,
                "delay": 1.25,
                "easing": "easeOut"
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "notes": "ADN DE MARCA — Editorial oscuro y cálido, anclado abajo-izquierda. UN solo acento (#D97757, el terracota de Anthropic) y aparece una vez por lámina. Display serif de alto contraste (Didot) contra cuerpo sans y mono: jerarquía real de 5×. Numerales y formas fantasma al 6-8% dan profundidad sin ruido. Dos láminas invierten la paleta (06 y 11) para marcar capítulo. Hero 3D en portada y cierre como bookend; giros lentos (períodos 4-8s). DO: aire, asimetría, hairlines, mono para etiquetas. DON'T: centrar, degradados, segundo color, iconos redondos sobre cada título."
      }
    },
